benchmarks/magna_reproduction/original_optimization_inputs.py are adapted from
itpyi/magna, revision 56847478c840395735146ef1e1ccdc3d8aedc10f:

tests/core/test_simulator_optimization.py
tests/core/test_file_native.py
tests/core/test_native_boundary_service.py
tests/core/test_native_global_ownership.py
